{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661310/extras/banner-Hack_And_Climb.gif?t=1747046384\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>CURSED\u00a0</strong>into <strong>STEEL\u00a0</strong>and cast into the <strong>ABYSS</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<strong>HE</strong> left you to <strong>RUST</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Instead you <strong>CLIMB</strong>, one spiteful <strong>THROW\u00a0</strong>at a time...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Your <strong>RISE\u00a0</strong>will be his <strong>DOWNFALL</strong>....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661310/extras/fall_banner.gif?t=1747046384\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hack And Climb\u00a0</strong>is a <strong>physics</strong>-<strong>based</strong> platformer where you play as a <strong>cursed axe</strong> on a grueling ascent in search of revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661310/extras/simple-2.gif?t=1747046384\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661310/extras/banner-Master_the_axe.gif?t=1747046384\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MASTER THE AXE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wield your tool with <strong>precision</strong>. <strong>Every</strong> throw is a <strong>risk</strong>, every landing a <strong>triumph</strong>. Miss your mark and pay the price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661310/extras/steam_embeded_axe_climb_x480-min.gif?t=1747046384\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661310/extras/banner-Unlock_the_arsenal.gif?t=1747046384\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UNLOCK THE ARSENAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master up to 4 unique weapons in this demo! Each of them with their own quirks and challenges.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661310/extras/weapon_morph_-_480-min.gif?t=1747046384\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661310/extras/banner-Conquer_the_climb.gif?t=1747046384\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEMO KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes a &quot;short version&quot; of the full gameplay, with a limited amount of unlockable weapons, and stages.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>4 Unlockable Weapons:\u00a0</strong>Get the chance to try out the first 4 weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>4 Stunning Landscapes</strong>:\u00a0Explore the first 4 environments of the game each with their own mechanics and challenges</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3661310?t=1747046384","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661310/91b1e847a0ce43f74c9d5de13a345d6879af1910/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747046384","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661310/d3b2e0b6a418f06f5cc240be01e74a5b567e7472/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747046384","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661310/d3b2e0b6a418f06f5cc240be01e74a5b567e7472/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747046384","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661310/extras/banner-Hack_And_Climb.gif?t=1747046384\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0